                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really hate to say this, but Tron 2.0 is cooked. It has so many software issues that you spent all of the time you would playing the game trying to get it to work. The game is SO old, so it needs patches, and alterations, and a \"Killer app\", and lots of how to videos from over a decade ago and it STILL doesn't work. I give up. I just let it sit on a blank screen for two hours so i can get the cool steam emotes. Maybe someone will fix it again, but until then it is unplayable.",
